{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PPwtdHB1cBHFp46WAVXPLY","type":"tool_result","content":"The release notes say `vitest list` now parses test files statically by default. They list this under Breaking Changes:\n\n- \"Parse files statically in vitest list by default\" (#11088)\n\nThe page doesn't name a flag to opt out. The \"by default\" wording implies the behavior can be changed, but the notes don't say how.\n\nRelated static-collection items:\n\n- Under Features, \"Promote parseSpecifications out of experimental\" (#11087) suggests the static parsing API is now stable.\n- Under Bug Fixes, \"Ignore computed member calls in static collection\" (#11085) and \"Treat test.describe as a suite during static collection\" (#11128) fix edge cases in static collection.\n- \"Unify typechecking and ast collection\" (#10449) merges the AST collection path with typechecking."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ad210a8-7382-46a1-a195-fbfa1c412077","uuid":"5a495fee-be2a-4e8d-8b8c-faf8134fd72b","timestamp":"2026-10-08T12:39:58.406Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":451731,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"The release notes say `vitest list` now parses test files statically by default. They list this under Breaking Changes:\n\n- \"Parse files statically in vitest list by default\" (#11088)\n\nThe page doesn't name a flag to opt out. The \"by default\" wording implies the behavior can be changed, but the notes don't say how.\n\nRelated static-collection items:\n\n- Under Features, \"Promote parseSpecifications out of experimental\" (#11087) suggests the static parsing API is now stable.\n- Under Bug Fixes, \"Ignore computed member calls in static collection\" (#11085) and \"Treat test.describe as a suite during static collection\" (#11128) fix edge cases in static collection.\n- \"Unify typechecking and ast collection\" (#10449) merges the AST collection path with typechecking.","durationMs":5301,"url":"https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/releases/tag/v5.0.0"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PPwtdHB1cBHFp46WAVXPLY","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
